  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the dry white wine, pasta water, ground cumin, ground coriander, salt, and black pepper to the tagine.",
    "Cover the tagine and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Braise the lamb for 2.5 hours, or until it is tender.",
    "Remove the tagine from the oven and let it cool for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the lamb and sauce hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro."
  ],
